@startuml fig-2-9-auth-github-seq
' GitHub-only authentication (email/password register/login removed).
'
' Arrow style: open / hollow arrowheads (black outline, white fill).
' - Do NOT use "skinparam style strictuml" — that draws solid filled triangles.
' - "sequenceArrowHead nice" keeps PlantUML's open (non-filled) arrowheads.
' Requires PlantUML 1.2021+ (VS Code PlantUML extension or plantuml.com).

hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceArrowHead nice
skinparam sequenceArrowColor black
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor black

title Authentication sequence — Sign in with GitHub

actor User
participant "Frontend SPA" as SPA
participant "Auth API" as API
database "MongoDB" as DB

User -> SPA : Click Sign in with GitHub
SPA -> API : GET /api/auth/github/start?next=...
API -> User : Redirect to GitHub authorize\n(scope: read:user, user:email)
User -> API : GET /api/auth/github/callback?code&state

activate API
API -> API : Exchange code for access token;\nfetch GitHub profile and email

API -> DB : find or create user by githubId
activate DB
return user record
deactivate DB

API -> API : sign JWT session
deactivate API

API -> User : Redirect /auth/finish?token&next
User -> SPA : Load /auth/finish

activate SPA
SPA -> API : GET /api/auth/me\n(Bearer JWT)
activate API
return user profile
deactivate API

SPA -> SPA : store session and route to dashboard
return authenticated dashboard access
deactivate SPA

@enduml
